                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This is an absolute party gem - get it, play it with some friends for 30 minutes and move on to the next game, satisfied.\n\nFrantic one-hit-kill game with neat crate physics, good with two but gets better the more people participate. After a couple of matches, a surprising tactical depth unfolds. Remote play together works well and is a good replacement for online multiplayer. \n\nPlayed excessively in local multiplayer on my friend's account, hence the short playtime.",
